  "definition": {
    "en": "Configurable axis: Structural Finishing. Cutting/shaping operations (die-cut, kiss-cut, laser-cut, perforation, routing, scoring), multi-select. Values from printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "nb": "Konfigurerbar akse: Strukturell etterbehandling. Skjære-/formingsoperasjoner (stansing, kiss-cut, laserskjæring, perforering, fresing, bigging), flervalg. Verdier fra printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "de": "Konfigurierbare Achse: Strukturelle Verarbeitung. Schneid-/Formoperationen (Stanzen, Kiss-Cut, Laserschnitt, Perforation, Fräsen, Rillen), Mehrfachauswahl. Werte aus printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "es": "Eje configurable: Acabado estructural. Operaciones de corte y conformado (troquelado, kiss-cut, corte láser, perforado, fresado, hendido), selección múltiple. Valores de printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "ja": "構成可能な軸：構造加工。切断・成形加工（型抜き、キスカット、レーザーカット、ミシン目、ルーター加工、スジ入れ）、複数選択。値は printing/completions/structural-finishing から。",
    "zh-Hans": "可配置轴：结构加工。切割/成形工艺（模切、半切、激光切割、打孔线、铣切、压痕），多选。取值来自 printing/completions/structural-finishing。",
    "sv": "Konfigurerbar axel: Strukturell efterbehandling. Skär-/formningsoperationer (stansning, kiss-cut, laserskärning, perforering, fräsning, bigning), flerval. Värden från printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "da": "Konfigurerbar akse: Strukturel efterbehandling. Skære-/formningsoperationer (udstansning, kiss-cut, laserskæring, perforering, fræsning, rilning), flervalg. Værdier fra printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "nl": "Configureerbare as: Structurele afwerking. Snij-/vormbewerkingen (stansen, kiss-cut, lasersnijden, perforeren, frezen, rillen), meerkeuze. Waarden uit printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "pl": "Oś konfigurowalna: Wykończenie strukturalne. Operacje cięcia/kształtowania (wykrawanie, kiss-cut, cięcie laserowe, perforacja, frezowanie, bigowanie), wybór wielokrotny. Wartości z printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "pt": "Eixo configurável: Acabamento Estrutural. Operações de corte/conformação (corte especial, meio-corte, corte a laser, picote, fresagem, vinco), seleção múltipla. Valores de printing/completions/structural-finishing.",
    "hi": "कॉन्फ़िगर करने योग्य अक्ष: संरचनात्मक फ़िनिशिंग। कटाई/आकार देने की क्रियाएँ (डाई-कट, किस-कट, लेज़र-कट, परफ़ोरेशन, राउटिंग, स्कोरिंग), बहु-चयन। मान printing/completions/structural-finishing से।"
  },
